Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.41,0:23:10.79,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1860,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}心の熱を　覚えていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.79,0:23:15.67,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1860,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}描く夢に見蕩れてる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.67,0:23:22.42,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1840,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}数えきれない\N今日を貴方と飾り付ける
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:31.10,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1840,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}想い出はひとつずつ\N宝箱にしまうの
